{"id": "20542309", "revid": "27823944", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20542309", "title": "Tracy's Landing Tobacco House No. 2", "text": "Tracy's Landing Tobacco House No. 2 is a historic tobacco barn at Tracy's Landing, Anne Arundel County, Maryland. It is a 24\u20193\" by 45\u20192\" heavy timber framed tobacco barn with a construction date of 1805. It is the earliest identified tobacco house extant in Anne Arundel County, and is one of the earliest recorded examples of this type of agricultural building in Tidewater Maryland.\nIt was listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 1982."}
