{"id": "20542792", "revid": "753665", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20542792", "title": "Time Waits for Everyone", "text": "Time Waits for Everyone is the ninth studio album by actor and musician Viggo Mortensen, released in 2007. It is Mortensen's first release to only feature himself playing piano without the collaboration of anyone else. All tracks are improvisations inspired from trips to Hungary, Germany, Poland, Russia, and according to Mortensen, remembrance of things past.\nThe album was released on Mortensen's label Perceval Press but was later re-released on TDRS Music along with his next album \"At All\".\nReferences.\nInformation of the album"}
