{"id": "20543286", "revid": "28438", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20543286", "title": "Le Tonnelier de Breteuil", "text": "The Le Tonnelier de Breteuil family was an influential and powerful French noble family, originated in Beauvais, northern France, whose members held many important political and military positions throughout history of the Kingdom of France. \nThe family was ennobled in 1582 and throughout centuries rose in prominence, being awarded the titles of Marquis, Count and Baron in France.\nSee Le Tonnelier for the list of notable members."}
