{"id": "20544766", "revid": "29463730", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20544766", "title": "Coltness High School", "text": "Coltness High School is a secondary school located in Coltness, the largest suburb of Wishaw, North Lanarkshire, Scotland. The school opened in 1966, and as of May 2015 had a roll of 780 pupils. The school serves the catchment area of Coltness and Cambusnethan, as well as settlements outside of Wishaw such as Cleland.\nFrom 2010 the school underwent a series of renovation works to modernise its aging facilities and reduce the likelihood of closure."}
